{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51316","headline":"药（一见《宋之问集》） · 陈润","name":"药（一见《宋之问集》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有嘉（宋作「卉」）秘神仙，君臣有礼焉。\n忻当苦口喻，不畏入肠偏。\n扁鹊功成日，神农定器然（宋作「品年」）。\n丹成如可待，鷄犬自闻天。\n（《文苑英华》三二七《花木》。\n此诗在宋之问《春泉洗药》後，缺姓名，据目录作陈润。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}